{"logId": "85493656-75c1-480e-8e3d-e41c2f7e6770", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [170, 141, 559, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[170.0, 141.0], [559.0, 141.0], [559.0, 172.0], [170.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：能够积极理性地寻找有效的方法沟通，彼此达成尊重对方思想观念和生活态度的共识，享受普遍价值观下的亲情状态。（尊重）", "block_bbox": [163, 216, 1010, 271], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 216.0], [1010.0, 216.0], [1010.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：享受亲情的美好，有良好的沟通方法引导或处理观念代沟。对于价值观相悖的方面，不强求对方按照自己的思想去做，虽然思想观念不同和对问题、对事物的看法和生活的态度不同，但能够相互尊重、求同存异，理解和支持对方按照自我意愿去活。彼此坚定地给予爱和后盾的力量。", "block_bbox": [163, 291, 1005, 377], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 291.0], [1005.0, 291.0], [1005.0, 377.0], [163.0, 377.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [166, 413, 283, 435], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 413.0], [282.0, 413.0], [282.0, 434.0], [166.0, 434.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、与父母有良好的表达爱的方式（如关怀问候、与父母拥抱等的习惯）", "block_bbox": [181, 453, 742, 475], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[187.0, 453.0], [741.0, 453.0], [741.0, 474.0], [187.0, 474.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、能够没有顾忌地、坦诚地与父母敞开心扉交流", "block_bbox": [182, 484, 577, 505], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 484.0], [576.0, 484.0], [576.0, 504.0], [182.0, 504.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、对彼此不同的观念，能够相互尊重、欣赏和认可", "block_bbox": [182, 514, 593, 536], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 514.0], [593.0, 514.0], [593.0, 536.0], [182.0, 536.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、通过有效的方式方法，一定程度上引导父母更加健康、品质的生活观念和习惯", "block_bbox": [182, 545, 825, 568], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 545.0], [825.0, 545.0], [825.0, 568.0], [182.0, 568.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、鼓励父母多接触、尝试新鲜事物，有属于自己的爱好", "block_bbox": [183, 575, 629, 597], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 575.0], [629.0, 575.0], [629.0, 597.0], [183.0, 597.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、对父母在家庭关系中不正确的思想和行为，及时制止和沟通引导", "block_bbox": [183, 606, 718, 628], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 606.0], [718.0, 606.0], [718.0, 628.0], [183.0, 628.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、活好自己的生命，是对父母最大的孝顺和报答", "block_bbox": [183, 637, 576, 659], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 637.0], [576.0, 637.0], [576.0, 659.0], [183.0, 659.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[58]", "block_bbox": [573, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [206, 901, 596, 932], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[206.0, 901.0], [596.0, 901.0], [596.0, 932.0], [206.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与父母平等相处的状态。（平等）", "block_bbox": [200, 976, 1040, 1031], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 976.0], [1040.0, 976.0], [1040.0, 1031.0], [200.0, 1031.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女是相互独立的生命个体，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，彼此之间除了法定的教育和赡养责任外，各自有各自的生命和生活。父母与子女之间像朋友一样平等、坦率地相处，几乎没有避而不谈的话题。彼此也不承担相互之间的愿望继承。", "block_bbox": [199, 1052, 1051, 1135], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1052.0], [1051.0, 1052.0], [1051.0, 1135.0], [199.0, 1135.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1153, 319, 1175], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1153.0], [318.0, 1153.0], [318.0, 1174.0], [202.0, 1174.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、与父母是朋友的关系，可以平等、坦率、自然地交流，几乎没有避而不谈的话题", "block_bbox": [219, 1188, 879, 1211], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1188.0], [879.0, 1188.0], [879.0, 1211.0], [219.0, 1211.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不因父母问题影响自己正常生活（如父母疾病、生活不能自理、父母感情等）", "block_bbox": [218, 1217, 851, 1240], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1217.0], [851.0, 1217.0], [851.0, 1240.0], [218.0, 1240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、不要求父母帮忙带孩子（不束缚父母、引导父母过自己独立的生活；避免两代人的教育观念不同产生矛盾和摩擦，主要由夫妻双方承担抚养和教育孩子的职责）", "block_bbox": [218, 1248, 1049, 1298], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1248.0], [1049.0, 1248.0], [1049.0, 1298.0], [218.0, 1298.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不与父母同住", "block_bbox": [220, 1306, 362, 1327], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[220.00001525878906, 1305.9998779296875], [361.0, 1305.9998779296875], [361.0, 1325.9998779296875], [220.00001525878906, 1325.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [203, 1346, 338, 1368], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 1346.0], [337.0, 1346.0], [337.0, 1367.0], [203.0, 1367.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、床前伺候，事事亲力亲为，精神包袱和痛苦极大", "block_bbox": [220, 1380, 630, 1402], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1380.0], [630.0, 1380.0], [630.0, 1402.0], [220.0, 1402.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、过度操办父母葬礼，为后人增加负担", "block_bbox": [219, 1410, 543, 1431], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1410.0], [542.0, 1410.0], [542.0, 1430.0], [219.0, 1430.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[59]", "block_bbox": [611, 1478, 648, 1497], "block_id": 23, "block_order": null, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1478.0], [647.0, 1478.0], [647.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.832985520362854, "coordinate": [170, 141, 559, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[170.0, 141.0], [559.0, 141.0], [559.0, 172.0], [170.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8211914896965027, "coordinate": [163, 216, 1010, 271], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 216.0], [1010.0, 216.0], [1010.0, 271.0], [163.0, 271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9301266670227051, "coordinate": [163, 291, 1005, 377], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 291.0], [1005.0, 291.0], [1005.0, 377.0], [163.0, 377.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.4528491199016571, "coordinate": [166, 413, 283, 435], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 413.0], [282.0, 413.0], [282.0, 434.0], [166.0, 434.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7648226022720337, "coordinate": [181, 453, 742, 475], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[187.0, 453.0], [741.0, 453.0], [741.0, 474.0], [187.0, 474.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7456843852996826, "coordinate": [18